        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Since our inception in 2013, we have focused our efforts and financial resources on acquiring and developing product and technology rights, building our intellectual property portfolio and conducting research and development activities for our product candidates.",
